# Marker so stow owns ~/.config/Yubico: stow never links `.gitignore` (it is in
# stow's built-in ignore list) and git cannot track an empty directory, so this
# file is what makes the directory exist on every machine.
#
# The pam_u2f mapping that lives here is per-machine key state, written by
# `just setup-u2f` (pamu2fcfg), and must never be committed - see .gitignore.
